@startuml
left to right direction
actor "Programuotojas" as Dev
actor "Gemini API" as Gemini
rectangle "Python kodo peržiūros asistentas" {
  usecase "Pateikti kodą ir sutartį" as Submit
  usecase "Atlikti kodo peržiūrą" as Review
  usecase "Atrinkti 3 pavyzdžius" as Retrieve
  usecase "Gauti JSON ir rekomendaciją" as Result
  usecase "Priimti arba atmesti pataisą" as Decide
}
Dev --> Submit
Dev --> Review
Review ..> Retrieve : <<include>>
Gemini --> Review
Review ..> Result : <<include>>
Dev --> Result
Dev --> Decide
